## Architecture Review Board (ARB) Checklist

<div class="portal-checklist-box">
  <div class="portal-checklist-title">ARCHITECTURE CONFORMANCE CHECKLIST</div>
  <p>Before advancing a new mobile initiative into production sprint planning, ensure your project satisfies these architectural baselines:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Layer Separation Verified:</strong> Repository structure mirrors the Presentation, Domain, Data, and Core package layout.</li>
    <li><strong>Unidirectional Data Flow:</strong> ViewModels emit single immutable state streams; UI dispatches explicit user intents.</li>
    <li><strong>Circuit Breaker Configured:</strong> External HTTP endpoints are configured with failure thresholds and fallback local caches.</li>
    <li><strong>ADRs Documented:</strong> Any deviations from tier-1 standards have an approved ADR committed in the <code>docs/adr/</code> directory.</li>
    <li><strong>Zero Security Leaks:</strong> Credentials and API tokens are resolved at runtime via Enterprise SSO and stored in secure hardware enclaves.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
